<section class="section reveal" style="max-width:720px;margin:0 auto">
<h2 style="text-align:center">CANCELLATION & EXCHANGE POLICY</h2>
<p class="sub" style="text-align:center">PLEASE READ BEFORE ORDERING</p>
<p>Once an order is placed, it cannot be canceled unless the product arrives damaged. A product opening video is mandatory for any exchange request.</p>
<h3 style="font-size:13px;letter-spacing:3px;margin-top:24px">OPENING VIDEO REQUIREMENTS</h3>
<ul style="margin-top:8px;font-size:14px;line-height:2">
<li>A complete product opening video, starting from the sealed package, is mandatory for any exchange request</li>
<li>You must also provide clear photos of the damaged product and its outer packaging</li>
<li>Begin with a clear 360° view of the sealed package, showing all sides of the parcel</li>
<li>Clearly demonstrate that the package has not been opened, tampered with, or damaged from any side</li>
<li>Show the entire unboxing process in one continuous, unedited video</li>
<li>Capture the product clearly as it is removed from the packaging</li>
<li>Any damages, defects, or missing items must be shown clearly in the same video</li>
</ul>
<p style="margin-top:8px">Once we verify the damage, we will arrange a replacement as applicable. No exchanges are allowed except in the case of verified damaged products.</p>
<h3 style="font-size:13px;letter-spacing:3px;margin-top:24px">COLOR GUARANTEE & REPLACEMENT</h3>
<p style="margin-top:8px">All stainless steel products are covered by a 1-Year Color Guarantee from the date of purchase.</p>
<h4 style="font-size:12px;letter-spacing:2px;margin-top:16px">ELIGIBLE FOR EXCHANGE / REPLACEMENT</h4>
<p style="margin-top:8px">Metal color fading or color change of the stainless steel product.</p>
<h4 style="font-size:12px;letter-spacing:2px;margin-top:16px">NOT COVERED UNDER WARRANTY</h4>
<ul style="margin-top:8px;font-size:14px;line-height:2">
<li>Scratches, dents, breakage, bending, or any physical damage</li>
<li>Damage, loosening, loss, or detachment of artificial stones, diamonds, crystals, pearls, or decorative elements</li>
<li>Damage caused by perfumes, deodorants, alcohol-based products, cosmetics, chemicals, cleaning agents, or other external substances</li>
<li>Any misuse, improper handling, or accidental damage</li>
<li>Only metal color fading/change qualifies for an exchange or replacement</li>
<li>Brass products are not covered under the Color Guarantee or Exchange Policy</li>
</ul>
<ul style="margin-top:8px;font-size:14px;line-height:2">
<li>The customer must send the product back to us for verification within 7-10 days after raising the complaint</li>
<li>Once the item is received and verified, we will initiate the exchange within 7 working days</li>
</ul>
<h3 style="font-size:13px;letter-spacing:3px;margin-top:24px">SHIPPING COSTS FOR EXCHANGES</h3>
<ul style="margin-top:8px;font-size:14px;line-height:2">
<li>If the item is damaged during shipping, we will cover the return shipping cost</li>
<li>A complete packaging video is mandatory to verify shipping damage</li>
<li>If the product was received in perfect condition and later damaged by the customer, the customer will be responsible for all shipping costs</li>
</ul>
<p style="margin-top:16px"><strong>We only provide exchanges — no returns or refunds are accepted under any circumstances. Once an order is placed, it cannot be canceled.</strong></p>
<p style="margin-top:8px">This policy applies to all purchases made from Newds.Co, whether through our official website, via Instagram DMs, at flea market events, physical stores, or through any of our partner stores.</p>
</section>
